      },
      "message": "feat(ui): a refused Create click opens the tool library or the workspace list\n\nClicking a dark operation cell (or dropdown row) still names why on the\nstatus line, and now also takes the user to the fix: with no fitting\ntool the Tool library page opens; with a kind the mounted machine cannot\nrun the machine door opens on its workspace list.\n\nFixes #191\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
