      },
      "message": "feat(ui): Create cells darken without stock and open the Stock page\n\nEvery ribbon-made operation machines the active setup's stock, so with\nno stock the Create cells stayed lit and then refused \"no stock; set up\nstock first\" on a dim status line. They now darken with a \"set up stock\nfirst\" tip, and a click names it and opens the Stock page (#191's gate\nroute).\n\nFixes #216\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
